<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Skribe CS Command Center — Win-Back &amp; Watchlist Board</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@600;700&family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    color-scheme: light;
    /* Skribe brand: NAVY #02178C · BLUE #3155EC · LIGHT BLUE #CCD1EB · DARK #1A1A1A · GRAY #74787C · OFF WHITE #FAFAFA */
    --surface:#ffffff; --page:#FAFAFA; --ink:#1A1A1A; --ink2:#4c5054; --muted:#74787C;
    --grid:#e4e6ef; --axis:#CCD1EB; --border:rgba(2,23,140,0.14);
    --navy:#02178C; --blue:#3155EC; --blue-lt:#CCD1EB;
    --good:#0ca30c; --warn:#fab219; --serious:#ec835a; --critical:#d03b3b;
    --good-tx:#006300; --head-ink:#02178C;
    --font-head:'Poppins',system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
    --font-body:'DM Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      color-scheme: dark;
      --surface:#1a1a1c; --page:#0e0e12; --ink:#ffffff; --ink2:#c3c5cf; --muted:#8a8e97;
      --grid:#2c2c32; --axis:#383845; --border:rgba(204,209,235,0.16);
      --navy:#02178C; --blue:#7d92f5; --blue-lt:#232d63; --good-tx:#0ca30c; --head-ink:#b9c3f5;
    }
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{font-family:var(--font-body);background:var(--page);color:var(--ink);padding:0 24px 24px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45}
  h1,h2,h3,h4,.tile .val,.ob-head h2{font-family:var(--font-head)}
  h1,.card h3,.tile .val{color:var(--head-ink)}
  /* Skribe brand bar */
  .brandbar{background:#02178C;margin:0 -24px 18px;padding:14px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .brandbar img{height:44px;display:block}
  .brandtag{color:#CCD1EB;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.02em;font-family:var(--font-body)}
  /* onboarding section */
  .ob-section{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface);margin-bottom:16px;overflow:hidden}
  .ob-head{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#02178C,#3155EC);color:#fff;padding:8px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .ob-head h2{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700}
  .ob-head .obsub{font-size:11.5px;color:#CCD1EB}
  .ob-count{margin-left:auto;background:#fff;color:#02178C;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px;font-size:11.5px}
  .ob-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(290px,1fr));gap:10px;padding:10px}
  .ob-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--page)}
  .ob-card h4{font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .ob-new{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:.05em}
  .ob-when{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;margin-left:auto}
  .w-today{background:var(--critical);color:#fff}.w-soon{background:var(--serious);color:#fff}.w-later{background:var(--grid);color:var(--ink2)}
  .ob-card ul{list-style:none;margin:6px 0}
  .ob-card li{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink2);padding:1px 0}
  .ob-card li b{color:var(--ink)}
  .norep{color:var(--critical);font-weight:600}
  .ob-foot{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}
  .ob-foot button{padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px}
  .ob-foot select,.ob-foot input{padding:4px 6px;font-size:11.5px}
  .ob-notes{width:100%;margin-top:6px;font-size:11.5px;min-height:28px;resize:vertical}
  h1{font-size:22px;font-weight:700}
  .sub{color:var(--ink2);margin-top:2px}
  header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .hdr-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
  button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 12px}
  button:hover{border-color:var(--blue)}
  button.primary{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}
  .wow-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);max-width:340px}
  /* KPI tiles */
  .tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .tile{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px}
  .tile .lbl{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2)}
  .tile .val{font-size:30px;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px}
  .tile .delta{font-size:12px;margin-top:2px;color:var(--muted)}
  .tile .delta.up{color:var(--good-tx)} .tile .delta.bad{color:var(--critical)}
  /* charts */
  .charts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px}
  .card h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
  .card .csub{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2);margin-bottom:8px}
  svg text{font-family:inherit}
  details.tbl{margin-top:6px;font-size:12px}
  details.tbl summary{color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
  details.tbl table{border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:6px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  details.tbl td,details.tbl th{border-bottom:1px solid var(--grid);padding:3px 10px 3px 0;text-align:right}
  details.tbl th:first-child,details.tbl td:first-child{text-align:left}
  .tip{position:fixed;pointer-events:none;background:var(--ink);color:var(--page);padding:5px 9px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;display:none;z-index:50}
  /* playbook */
  .plays{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .play{border-left:4px solid var(--axis)}
  .play h4{font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
  .play p{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:4px}
  .play .goal{font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}
  /* board */
  .board-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .chip{border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px}
  .chip.on{background:var(--ink);color:var(--page);border-color:var(--ink)}
  input[type=text],input[type=date],select,textarea{font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--page);color:var(--ink);border-radius:7px;padding:6px 8px}
  .firm{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden}
  .frow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;flex-wrap:wrap;cursor:pointer}
  .fname{font-weight:600;min-width:180px}
  .badge{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;color:#fff}
  .b-dark{background:var(--critical)} .b-cancel{background:var(--serious)} .b-summer{background:var(--warn);color:#0b0b0b} .b-single{background:var(--blue)}
  .fstats{display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2);flex-wrap:wrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .fstats b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .fright{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .status-sel{font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
  .st-0{}
  .st-1{border-color:var(--blue)} .st-2{border-color:var(--warn)} .st-3{border-color:var(--good)} .st-4{border-color:var(--good);background:var(--good);color:#fff} .st-5{border-color:var(--muted);color:var(--muted)} .st-6{border-color:var(--navy);background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
  .fdetail{display:none;border-top:1px solid var(--grid);padding:14px 16px;gap:18px}
  .firm.open .fdetail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr 1.2fr}
  @media (max-width:900px){.firm.open .fdetail{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .fdetail h5{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
  .fdetail ul{list-style:none}
  .fdetail li{font-size:12.5px;padding:2px 0;color:var(--ink2)}
  .fdetail li b{color:var(--ink)}
  .actgrid{display:grid;gap:8px}
  .actgrid label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
  .actgrid textarea{width:100%;min-height:56px;resize:vertical;font-size:12.5px}
  .why{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2);background:var(--page);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;margin-top:8px;border:1px solid var(--grid)}
  .wow-tag{font-size:11px;color:var(--good-tx);font-weight:600}
  /* modal */
  .modal-bg{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:100;padding:20px}
  .modal{background:var(--surface);border-radius:14px;max-width:720px;width:100%;max-height:90vh;overflow:auto;padding:22px}
  .modal h3{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:2px}
  .modal .msub{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2);margin-bottom:12px}
  .modal .row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .modal .row label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);width:60px}
  .modal input[type=text],.modal select{flex:1;min-width:200px}
  .modal textarea{width:100%;min-height:320px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px}
  .modal .mact{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .copied{color:var(--good-tx);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;display:none}
  footer{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="tip" id="tip"></div>

<div class="brandbar">
  <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Skribe — Testimony Lives Here">
  <span class="brandtag">CS Command Center</span>
</div>
<header>
  <div>
    <h1>CS Command Center</h1>
    <div class="sub">Onboarding, win-back &amp; watchlist · data through <b>Jul 30, 2026</b> · <span id="weekLbl"></span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hdr-actions">
    <div class="wow-note">This board runs in your browser session. <b>Export a snapshot when you finish</b>, and import last week's file next Monday to see week-over-week movement.</div>
    <button id="importBtn">Import last week</button>
    <input type="file" id="importFile" accept=".json" style="display:none">
    <button class="primary" id="exportBtn">Export snapshot</button>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="tiles" id="tiles"></div>

<div class="charts">
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Depositions held per business day</h3>
    <div class="csub">Holiday-adjusted. July −21% vs May peak; June held up despite school-out.</div>
    <div id="chartVol"></div>
    <details class="tbl"><summary>Data table</summary><div id="tblVol"></div></details>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Cancellation rate, % of scheduled</h3>
    <div class="csub">Baseline reset ~18% → ~25% in April — predates summer. Juneteenth week hit 38%.</div>
    <div id="chartCanc"></div>
    <details class="tbl"><summary>Data table</summary><div id="tblCanc"></div></details>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Forward book — depos on the calendar today</h3>
    <div class="csub">Sept is the test: fall dockets get set in the next 3 weeks. Typical month ≈ 275–290 held.</div>
    <div id="chartFwd"></div>
    <details class="tbl"><summary>Data table</summary><div id="tblFwd"></div></details>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="ob-section">
  <div class="ob-head">
    <h2>New Firm Onboarding</h2>
    <span class="obsub">First depos coming up — welcome + walkthrough before depo #1, tech check day before, follow-up after.</span>
    <span class="ob-count" id="obCount"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="ob-grid" id="obGrid"></div>
</div>

<div class="plays">
  <div class="card play" style="border-left-color:var(--critical)"><h4><span class="badge b-dark">TIER 1 · DARK</span></h4>
    <p>Silent since before summer — this is real risk, not vacation. Call, don't email-only. Reference their last depo by name; a lot has shipped since.</p><div class="goal">Goal: walkthrough booked within 7 days.</div></div>
  <div class="card play" style="border-left-color:var(--serious)"><h4><span class="badge b-cancel">HIGH CANCEL</span></h4>
    <p>Heavy users fighting witness &amp; opposing-counsel churn. Don't scold — make rescheduling frictionless and show them clips/summaries so cancelled prep isn't wasted.</p><div class="goal">Goal: every cancel rebooks inside 14 days.</div></div>
  <div class="card play" style="border-left-color:var(--warn)"><h4><span class="badge b-summer">RECENTLY QUIET</span></h4>
    <p>Quiet 6–8 weeks, nothing booked ahead. Summer is the <i>likely</i> explanation — treat it as a hypothesis, not a fact. Open with fall-docket planning; on the call, listen for competitor or budget signals and escalate to Tier 1 handling if you hear them.</p><div class="goal">Goal: Sept/Oct depo on our calendar by Labor Day.</div></div>
  <div class="card play" style="border-left-color:var(--blue)"><h4><span class="badge b-single">SINGLE-THREADED</span></h4>
    <p>One person is the whole relationship. If they leave, the firm goes dark. Praise the champion, then get a second scheduler trained via team walkthrough.</p><div class="goal">Goal: 2nd contact named &amp; trained per firm.</div></div>
</div>

<div class="board-head">
  <div class="chips" id="chips"></div>
  <input type="text" id="search" placeholder="Search firm…" style="width:200px">
</div>
<div id="board"></div>

<div class="modal-bg" id="modalBg">
  <div class="modal">
    <h3 id="mTitle">Outreach email</h3>
    <div class="msub" id="mSub"></div>
    <div class="row"><label>To</label><select id="mTo"></select></div>
    <div class="row"><label>Angle</label><select id="mAngle"></select></div>
    <div class="row"><label>Subject</label><input type="text" id="mSubject"></div>
    <textarea id="mBody"></textarea>
    <div class="mact">
      <button class="primary" id="mCopy">Copy email</button>
      <button id="mMail">Open in mail app</button>
      <button id="mMarkSent">Copy + mark "Outreach sent"</button>
      <button id="mClose" style="margin-left:auto">Close</button>
      <span class="copied" id="mCopied">Copied ✓</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>Built for the Skribe CS team · Flags computed from live-event history only (firms with ≥1 held live deposition) · Tier logic is seasonally calibrated: Tier 1 silence predates summer; "Recently quiet" overlaps it — the label states the behavior, the CSM confirms the cause. Edit any generated email before sending — you know the relationship.</footer>

<script>
